  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women count for peace:promoting the participation, representation and leadership of women in peacebuilding processes in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">to increase women&apos;s meaningful participation, representation, and leadership in peacebuilding and justice processes, conflict resolution, and strengthen access to justice for survivors of gender-based violence (GBV) and conflict-related sexual violence in conflict affected regions of Ethiopia through capacity development supports and creating cross-regional platforms.</narrative>
  </description>
